### 1) Seed demo events for multiple users
POST http://localhost:8097/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Analyze a specific user (targeted)
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/analyze/user-1001

### 3) Analyze next user in queue (discovery)
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/process-next

### 4) List all insights
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/insights

### 5) Built-in analytics: rapidly declining users
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/analytics/rapid-decline
